            "review_title": "Review at Ittou Ramen Thao Dien",
            "review_text": "Higuma 2017\nAustralia1284 contributions\n0\nComforting, calming, the food you most need.\nNov 2024 • Solo\nI have been here a few times. I know what I am having and it always delivers perfectly. It's consistent, flavourful, textured, comforting, it's calming, it brings me back \"home\". It tells me \"It's ok, it's ok, I'm here for you...\"\nTonight I had the maze-soba. Couldn't have had a better wish fulfilled in Saigon. Difficult for me to think of going anywhere else...\nRead more\nValue\nService\nFood\nAtmosphere\nWritten December 18, 2024",
            "rating": 5.0,
            "review_date": "2026-10-14",
            "travel_date": "Recent",
            "feature_depth_status": "Schema-Full-Features-Validated"
        },
