            "review_text": "MARIA ROSA P\nNew Cairo City, Egypt70 contributions\n0\nSpace Sunday with ramen\nSep 2024 • Family\nThe place is small but well organized. Friendly staff and speak good English. The ravioli are excellent and the ramen tastes spectacular. The beer is just right cold. We highly recommend . Come on.\nValue\nService\nFood\nAtmosphere\nTranslated from Italian\nShow original\nWritten September 22, 2024",
