            "review_title": "Review at Ittou Ramen Thao Dien",
            "review_text": "Higuma 2017\nAustralia1284 contributions\n1\nNo need to go anywhere else!\nAug 2022\nI couldn't be happier after a ramen as I am right now, just arriving in the hotel, maybe 1 hour since I left this restaurant. I don't know whether this Ittou is actually officially associated or a \"descendant\" of (the King of Tsukemen) Menya Itto from Shin-Koiwa, but this can easily and proudly carry the name, as it is amazing, gorgeous ramen. God, how much I was missing that flavour...The same chewy, perfect noodles, that gyokai soup that is an umami-bomb, perfect eggs, perfect menma, charsiu, everything. No lines to enter the restaurant, easy menu, nice service, pleasant atmosphere. I can comfortably say that this is the best ramen I have ever had outside of Japan. Omedettou gozaimasu!\nRead more\nValue\nService\nFood\nReview collected in partnership with this restaurant \nWritten August 23, 2022",
            "rating": 5.0,
            "review_date": "2026-10-14",
            "travel_date": "Recent",
