            "review_text": "desiremmwekb10\nHo Chi Minh City, Vietnam2964 contributions\n0\nSo rich, so creamy, so yummy, broth from heaven\nJan 2019 • Solo\nGot recommendation from Japanese foody to try out this place. Love the broth here. The broth was just excellent, so rich, so creamy, so yummy. I could have this broth all day, everyday!! The noodle here is the big type. Normally I would rather have the thin noodle, but big noodle here was alright, still enjoyable. As for topping, the charshu was a hit lean and thick; thus, it was not juicy and not tender as I would love, charshu was just average compared to other ramen shops. The seasoned egg was a different story, cooked just right, tasty. The best seasoned egg in all ramen shops. The seasoned bamboo shot was nice as well. Overall, heavenly broth and seasoned egg covered for the charshu and still made it a wonderful bowl of ramen. Enjoyed it.\nRead more\nWritten January 25, 2019\nNISHIIE HIRIOAKI\nThank you for coming!\nWritten March 21, 2019\nThis response is the subjective opinion of the management representative and not of Tripadvisor LLC nor of its partners.",
